## SQ-NS-01d | nightstand items survive the restart and drop on break
> pbot spawn qa 0 -60 0
> data get block 40 -60 10
> data get block 42 -60 10
count minecraft:sugar >= 2
> kill @e[type=item]
> setblock 40 -60 10 minecraft:air destroy
sleep 2
> execute positioned 40 -60 10 as @e[type=item,distance=..3] run data get entity @s Item.id
count "minecraft:sugar" >= 1
> kill @e[type=item]
